msgstr "启用"

msgid "The overlay appears while your hands are still on the keyboard; this keeps the next key from being taken as a choice"
msgstr "浮层弹出时手可能还在键盘上，避免下一个按键被当成选择"

msgid "Ignore duration:"
msgstr "忽略时长："
